  expr_cpp_err_sizeof_open.pcpp - break step of expr_cpp.pcpp:
  an unclosed sizeof( group (PR0063)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\expr_cpp_err_sizeof_open.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\expr_cpp_err_sizeof_open.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
